    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36499" root="كأب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأْبَآءُ</span></b>  <i>Grief, mourning, unhappiness, sorrow,</i> or
<i>sadness:</i> (K:) [in which sense the inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَآبَةٌ</span>
is more commonly used:] or <i>intense grief, &amp;c.:</i>
used both as an inf. n. and as an epithet.
(TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَئِيبٌ</span>.

